<title>USA: Enron Oil promotes four vice presidents.</title>
<headline>Enron Oil promotes four vice presidents.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas Co on Tuesday said it promoted four vice presidents to senior vice president positions in their respective areas of responsibility.</p>
<p>The company said Loren M. Leiker was elected senior vice president for exploration; Jeffrey B. Sherrick, senior vice president for acquisitions and engineering; Gary L. Thomas, senior vice president and general manager of the Midland division; and William R. Thomas, senior vice president and general manager of the Corpus Christi division.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
